{"id": "ln-l0-u1-03", "title": {"ar": "الحروف: ذ ر ز س", "en": "Letters: ذ ر ز س", "fr": "Lettres : ذ ر ز س"}, "teach": [{"type": "text", "text": "Les lettres 9 à 12 sur 28. Observez les points : ils permettent de distinguer de nombreuses lettres."}, {"type": "letter", "ch": "ذ", "name": "dhaal", "sound": "dh (son anglais sonore, langue entre les dents)", "note": "Comme د, avec un point au-dessus.", "dots": "un point au-dessus", "forms": {"iso": "ذ", "fin": "‍ذ"}, "word": {"ar": "ذُرَة", "en": "maïs"}}, {"type": "letter", "ch": "ر", "name": "raa", "sound": "r (un « r » roulé rapidement)", "note": "Une courbe qui descend sous la ligne. Elle ne se lie pas à la lettre suivante.", "dots": "aucun point", "forms": {"iso": "ر", "fin": "‍ر"}, "word": {"ar": "رَجُل", "en": "homme"}}, {"type": "letter", "ch": "ز", "name": "zaay", "sound": "z", "note": "Comme ر, avec un point au-dessus.", "dots": "un point au-dessus", "forms": {"iso": "ز", "fin": "‍ز"}, "word": {"ar": "زَهْرَة", "en": "fleur"}}, {"type": "letter", "ch": "س", "name": "seen", "sound": "s", "note": "Trois petites dents, sans point.", "dots": "aucun point", "forms": {"iso": "س", "fin": "‍س", "ini": "س‍", "med": "‍س‍"}, "word": {"ar": "سَمَكَة", "en": "poisson"}}], "practice": [{"type": "mcq", "prompt": "Quelle lettre s’appelle « dhaal » ?", "options": ["ر", "ز", "ذ", "س"], "answer": 2, "explain": "ذ s’appelle dhaal.", "id": "ln-l0-u1-03_p1"}, {"type": "mcq", "prompt": "Comment s’appelle cette lettre : ر", "options": ["zaay", "raa", "dhaal", "seen"], "answer": 1, "explain": "ر s’appelle raa.", "id": "ln-l0-u1-03_p2"}, {"type": "match", "prompt": "Associez chaque lettre à son nom", "pairs": [["ذ", "dhaal"], ["ر", "raa"], ["ز", "zaay"], ["س", "seen"]], "explain": "Observez la forme et les points.", "id": "ln-l0-u1-03_p3"}, {"type": "mcq", "prompt": "Le mot زَهْرَة signifie :", "options": ["maïs", "homme", "poisson", "fleur"], "answer": 3, "explain": "زَهْرَة = fleur. Le mot commence par ز.", "id": "ln-l0-u1-03_p4"}], "quiz": [{"type": "mcq", "prompt": "Quelle lettre produit ce son : s ?", "options": ["س", "ذ", "ز", "ر"], "answer": 0, "explain": "س (seen) = s.", "id": "ln-l0-u1-03_q1"}, {"type": "mcq", "prompt": "Combien de points ر a-t-elle, et où ?", "options": ["Deux points en dessous", "Un point au-dessus", "Aucun point", "Deux points au-dessus"], "answer": 2, "explain": "ر n’a aucun point.", "id": "ln-l0-u1-03_q2"}, {"type": "mcq", "prompt": "Comment s’appelle cette lettre : ز", "options": ["raa", "seen", "dhaal", "zaay"], "answer": 3, "explain": "ز s’appelle zaay.", "id": "ln-l0-u1-03_q3"}, {"type": "tf", "prompt": "Vrai ou faux : ذ s’appelle « dhaal ».", "answer": true, "explain": "Exact, ذ s’appelle dhaal.", "id": "ln-l0-u1-03_q4"}, {"type": "type", "prompt": "Tapez le nom de cette lettre (avec des lettres latines) : س", "answers": ["seen"], "explain": "س s’appelle seen.", "id": "ln-l0-u1-03_q5"}, {"type": "mcq", "prompt": "Le mot رَجُل signifie :", "options": ["maïs", "homme", "poisson", "fleur"], "answer": 1, "explain": "رَجُل = homme.", "id": "ln-l0-u1-03_q6"}, {"type": "mcq", "prompt": "Quel mot commence par la lettre ز ?", "options": ["زَهْرَة", "ذُرَة", "سَمَكَة", "رَجُل"], "answer": 0, "explain": "زَهْرَة (fleur) commence par ز.", "id": "ln-l0-u1-03_q7"}, {"type": "mcq", "prompt": "Quel son ذ produit-elle ?", "options": ["s", "r (un « r » roulé rapidement)", "z", "dh (son anglais sonore, langue entre les dents)"], "answer": 3, "explain": "ذ (dhaal) = dh (son anglais sonore, langue entre les dents).", "id": "ln-l0-u1-03_q8"}]}